      "name": "SetupBinkState",
      "signature": "void SetupBinkState(int nStateType)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Sets up Bink video renderer state based on type parameter.\n\n  Algorithm:\n  1. Check if global renderer is initialized (0x6f8baa70)\n  2. If initialized and param matches current state, return\n  3. Based on nStateType (0=init, 1=state1, 2=state2), invoke renderer methods:\n     - State 0: calls vftable[0x3][0x1][0x0] then [0x3][0x4][0x0] then [0x0][0xf]\n     - State 1: calls vftable[0x4][0x1][0x0] then [0x4][0x4][0x0] then [0x1][0xf]\n     - State 2: returns without action\n  4. Update global state (0x6f8baa70) with new state type\n\n  Parameters:\n  ECX: nStateType - Renderer state type (0, 1, or 2)\n\n  Returns:\n  void\n\n  Special Cases:\n  - Returns early if renderer not initialized or state unchanged\n  - Calls multiple virtual methods on Bink renderer object (0x6f8baa94)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
