      "name": "ShutdownRenderer",
      "signature": "void ShutdownRenderer(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Shutdown renderer and cleanup graphics resources.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Load renderer instance pointer from g_pRendererInstance global\n  2. Test if pointer is non-NULL\n  3. If NULL, skip cleanup and return\n  4. If non-NULL:\n     a. Load vtable pointer from instance + offset 0x0\n     b. Call virtual method at vtable offset + 0x8 (destructor)\n     c. Clear renderer instance to NULL\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Safe to call multiple times (NULL check prevents re-free)\n  - Assumes g_pRendererInstance points to valid vtable if non-NULL\n  - Method at offset 0x8 is virtual destructor responsible for cleanup",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:a924888e949791099872c68b34c67709",
