      "name": "GetBinkVideoInfoValue",
      "signature": "uint GetBinkVideoInfoValue(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Returns the current Bink video info value if available.\n\n  Algorithm:\n  1. Load global Bink video info pointer from g_pBinkVideoInfo\n  2. Check if second field (offset 0x4) is non-zero\n  3. If set, return first field (offset 0x0) value\n  4. Otherwise return 0\n\n  Parameters:\n  (none)\n\n  Returns:\n  - Bink video info value if g_pBinkVideoInfo[1] is non-zero\n  - 0 if g_pBinkVideoInfo[1] is zero or invalid",
