      "name": "InitializeGraphicsData",
      "signature": "void InitializeGraphicsData(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initialize graphics rendering data structures and Direct3D vertex buffers.\n\n  Algorithm:\n  1. Initialize D3D transformed lit vertex buffer (D3DTLVERTEX array)\n     with texture coordinates and vertex color data\n  2. Build vertex array for 4x3 grid using nested loops\n     - Outer: iterate row from 0 to array bounds\n     - Inner: iterate column from 0 to 3\n     - Calculate vertex Y from row: (row * scale * multiplier) + offset\n     - Calculate vertex X from column: (col * scale * multiplier) + offset\n  3. Process rendering surface/tile data array\n     left-shift all 16-bit values by 0x10 for coordinate encoding\n\n  Parameters: void (no parameters)\n\n  Returns: void (initializes global graphics data structures)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:cac282b5dcd6a07d352e8f3f61aec66f",
