      "name": "CreateIsometricTileVertexBuffer",
      "signature": "void CreateIsometricTileVertexBuffer(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Creates and populates a Direct3D vertex buffer for rendering isometric floor tiles.\n\n  Algorithm:\n    1. Initialize D3DVERTEXBUFFERDESC with size 0x10 (16), caps 0x10800 (D3DVBCAPS_WRITEONLY | D3DVBCAPS_SYSTEMMEMORY),\n       FVF 0x1c4 (D3DFVF_XYZRHW | D3DFVF_TEX2), and 0x24 (36) vertices\n    2. Calculate texture coordinate Y scale: (g_fTileWidth / g_dwFloorTileHeight) * g_fTexCoordScale\n    3. Create vertex buffer via IDirect3DDevice3::CreateVertexBuffer (vtable offset 0x24)\n    4. Lock vertex buffer via IDirect3DVertexBuffer::Lock with flags 0x21 (D3DLOCK_WRITEONLY | D3DLOCK_NOSYSLOCK)\n    5. Generate 6x6 grid of vertices (36 total) with isometric projection:\n       - Apply edge adjustments at grid boundaries (row/col == 0 or 5)\n       - Set RHW to 0.5 (0x3f000000) and specular to 1.0 (0x3f800000) for all vertices\n       - Calculate texture U: (col - row) * stride + (offsetX + 0x50) / g_dwSavesDirFlag\n       - Calculate texture V: offsetY / g_dwFloorTileHeight + (col + row) * flTexCoordScaleY\n    6. Unlock vertex buffer via IDirect3DVertexBuffer::Unlock (vtable offset 0x10)\n    7. Generate 5 rows of 6 index pairs for triangle strip rendering\n    8. Copy index data to global g_aTileIndexBuffer\n\n  Parameters:\n    None - uses global state (g_pD3DDevice, g_dwFloorTileHeight, g_fTileWidth, g_fTexCoordScale)\n\n  Returns:\n    void - Returns early on D3D error (CreateVertexBuffer, Lock, or Unlock failure)\n\n  Special Cases:\n    - Edge vertices (row/col 0 or 5) get adjusted offsets for seamless tile edges\n    - Uses HandleDirect3DError for CreateVertexBuffer failures\n    - Uses LogDirectDrawError for Lock/Unlock failures\n\n  Globals Modified:\n    - g_pTileVertexBuffer: Receives created vertex buffer pointer\n    - g_aTileIndexBuffer: Receives computed triangle strip indices\n\n  Structure Layout (D3DVERTEXBUFFERDESC):\n    Offset  Size  Field          Type    Description\n    0x00    4     dwSize         DWORD   Structure size (0x10)\n    0x04    4     dwCaps         DWORD   Buffer capabilities (0x10800)\n    0x08    4     dwFVF          DWORD   Flexible vertex format (0x1c4)\n    0x0c    4     dwNumVertices  DWORD   Vertex count (0x24 = 36)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:dffa6e4b13243ce53cf3e2f5fe8fc08a",
