      "name": "RenderTilesToVertexBuffer",
      "signature": "void RenderTilesToVertexBuffer(uint dwTileProjectId, byte * pTileData, float * pVertexBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Renders tile data to a DirectDraw vertex buffer for display.\n\n  Algorithm:\n  1. Check if tile rendering to surface succeeded (via RenderTileFloorToSurface)\n  2. Setup Bink video state and configure rendering quality mode based on alpha flag\n  3. Configure alpha blend mode based on render type parameter\n  4. Check if Bink video is active\n  5. If active (Bink path):\n     - Lock vertex buffer (0x21 = D3DLOCK_DISCARD)\n     - Convert tile color palette data using lookup table at 0x6f8c3270\n     - Convert tile coordinate data (X, Y, Z) from integers to floats\n     - Process 4 vertex groups at fixed offsets (0x0, 0x3c, 0x1a4, 0x168)\n     - Unlock vertex buffer\n     - Draw to surface via DrawIndexedPrimitive call 6 (quad list, 4 vertices)\n  6. If inactive (non-Bink path):\n     - Lock vertex buffer\n     - Loop 0x24 (36) times processing 12-byte vertex stride\n     - Convert palette colors and coordinates as above\n     - Unlock vertex buffer\n     - Draw to surface via DrawIndexedPrimitive call 5 (triangle list, 0x41 vertices)\n\n  Parameters:\n  nTileProjectId (ECX): Tile project ID passed to RenderTileFloorToSurface\n  pTileData (EDX): Pointer to source tile data structure with color/coord bytes at various offsets\n  pVertexBuffer (via stack): Pointer to D3D vertex buffer for output\n\n  Returns:\n  Nothing (void), but modifies pVertexBuffer and renders to display device\n\n  Special Cases:\n  - Early exit if RenderTileFloorToSurface fails\n  - Early exit if vertex buffer lock/unlock fails (logs DirectDraw error)\n  - Bink video state affects rendering path (active = 4 vertex groups, inactive = 36-vertex loop)\n  - Alpha blend mode selection (1=opaque, 2=transparent) affects rendering quality",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:baef1e8849978b13a30efad0c631e81c",
